  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening self-management capacities and improving the quality of life in the community of Uaxactn, Flores, Petn, Guatemala.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indigenous Guatemalans living in Petn lack opportunities to prosper in their home communities. Sociedad Civil de Nombre Organizacin, Manejo y Conservacin (OMYC) works to create opportunities for the residents of the community of Uaxactn by promoting income generation, strengthening governance, and enhancing peace and security. At the IAF, we work to expand economic opportunities in Guatemala. OMYCs grant activities encourage small business growth and local entrepreneurship to ensure meaningful opportunities for communities to thrive. This grant is part of our broader initiative to support economic prosperity, democracy and governance consistent with the U.S. Strategy for Engagement in Central America.</narrative>
  </description>
